    "sentence": "This is particularly suggested when one of the side lengths is irrational, like $9\\sqrt{33}$, as it usually simplifies the problem or leads to cancellation of irrational terms, which occurs if $\\cos(\\angle U)=0$ (i.e., $\\angle U = 90^\\circ$).",
